        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yakobo abarira Labani ati: “Igihe twavuganye kiraheze, mpa umugore nakoreye kugira ngo tubane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Labani atumira abantu bo muri ako karere agira umusi mukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko hageze ku mugoroba, afata umukobwa wiwe Leya aba ari we aha Yakobo, maze Yakobo aryamana na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aha umukobwa wiwe Leya incoreke yiwe Zilupa kugira ngo imukorere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo avyutse mu gitondo, asanga yararanye na Leya. Abwira Labani ati: “Ibi wankoreye ni ibiki? Sinagukoreye imyaka indwi twumvikanye ko umpa Rasheli? Ni kuki wambeshe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aramwishura ati: “Mu migenzo ya hano iwacu ntivyemewe gushingira umukobwa muto imbere y’umukobwa mukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rangiza iyi ndwi y’inkinga, hanyuma nzoheza ndaguhe Rasheli niwemera kunkorera iyindi myaka indwi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yakobo yemera gukora iyindi myaka indwi. Amaze imisi indwi arongoye Leya, Labani umushingira na Rasheli na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani atanga incoreke yiwe Biluha kugira ngo akorere umukobwa wiwe Rasheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yakobo aryamana na Rasheli na we, kandi urukundo yamukunda rwaruta urwo yakunda Leya. Amara iyindi myaka indwi akorera Labani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
